# Testing (ISTQB Foundation Level)

Use the Foundation Level v4.0 **five test levels** as the baseline.

## Test levels

| Level | Purpose | Examples |
|-------|---------|----------|
| **Component** | Unit behavior | Pure functions, domain logic, schema validation |
| **Component integration** | Interfaces between components | API + service (DB/external APIs faked) |
| **System** | Whole-system functional / non-functional | Primary user-flow E2E |
| **System integration** | Interfaces with externals | Real external API / DB (fixtures / contracts) |
| **Acceptance** | Meets acceptance criteria | Scenarios from requirements |

